# Live, named only: every item of the chat panel's Emote tab in a starbase (the avatar's 33, ui_chat_panel.cpp's
# 0xB7C398 for a male avatar), each an AVATAR_EMOTE and the server's AVATAR_EMOTE_RESPONSE; compare the animations
# each loads (d3d8shot.log's ABANIM lines) between retail and ours.
name: starbase: every avatar emote from the Emote tab
timeout: 600
include _sb_home
# Agree
click gadget chat.tab.emote
alive 0.5
click 720,68
expect-event antprox 'received AVATAR_EMOTE$' within 10
expect-event antprox 'sent AVATAR_EMOTE_RESPONSE' within 10
alive 4
# Bored
click gadget chat.tab.emote
